Package: novapinyin
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: NovaPinyin contributors <noreply@github.com>
Depends: @DEPENDS@, fcitx5-frontend-gtk3, fcitx5-frontend-qt5, im-config, iso-codes, xkb-data, python3 (>= 3.8), python3-tk, git
Homepage: https://github.com/pyaude/nova-pinyin
Description: NovaPinyin with a private Fcitx5 runtime for Ubuntu 20.04 X11
 Local Chinese pinyin input, dictionaries, learning, context and developer
 completions. Includes private Fcitx5 5.1.7 and LibIME 1.1.5 libraries and
 data without replacing system libraries. Automatically activate on the next X11 user login.
